{"v":1,"st":"NV","e":"2022-11-08","src":{"carson-city-summary":["Carson City Clerk-Recorder: Summary Results Report, General Election, November 8, 2022","https://www.carsoncity.gov/home/showpublisheddocument/83243/638073885954870000","official",1,"2026-10-23","70f441afdd19db57017d8db6ec4329e93f3acabd795f9746dcb9920d5e148f23",0],"churchill-summary":["Churchill County Clerk-Treasurer: Election Summary Report, General Election, November 8, 2022","https://www.churchillcountynv.gov/ArchiveCenter/ViewFile/Item/1366","official",1,"2026-10-23","170dc475a4ab5b76416585646926a89bf843b4c73fe2d115477d761a10d5fb69",1],"clark-official":["Clark County Election Department: 22G Official Election Results","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx","official",1,"2026-10-23","63674770489fa414b630661ef5b8f7c87cbf02fad91dc527e57515934eb9434d",2],"clerk-statistics":["Office of the Clerk, U.S. House of Representatives: Statistics of the Congressional Election of November 8, 2022","https://clerk.house.gov/member_info/electionInfo/2022/statistics2022.pdf","official",1,"2026-10-16","ef9b8cefcc44bebbdc4928bf346b50e00a72dd3bb54a71ed93ec60d4ebf47690",3],"douglas-summary":["Douglas County Clerk-Treasurer: 2022 General Election supporting material (Appendix B, Election Summary Report)","https://cltr.douglascountynv.gov/UserFiles/Servers/Server_18102038/File/Elections/WebResults/2022/GE/FullSupportingMaterialForWeb_GE22.pdf","official",1,"2026-10-23","5881a2118cd6c5d6dcd25cbe72a8459ba804df4f061aa1d8bf35447af2cc3882",4]},"notes":["Headed 'Summary Results Report OFFICIAL RESULTS', 'Election Summary - 11/16/2022'.","Headed 'OFFICIAL FINAL RESULTS' (11/17/2022). Pages read: 1 to 8 of the PDF; the report prints 'OFFICIAL FINAL RESULTS' (11/17/2022 9:26:43 AM).","The county's results page with this election and 'OFFICIAL ELECTION RESULTS' chosen: each contest's county figures and its 'VOTE FOR' count; the page bolds the leading names. It prints each partisan candidate's party in front of the name ('DEM - Titus, Dina').","Compiled by the Clerk from official sources; Nevada's section on page 29 of the PDF. Read for the federal contests' statewide figures (the control) and winners. The copy on this computer was saved by another state's loader (states_cache/al_local/clerk_statistics2022.pdf).","The county's package with its letter of 18 Nov 2022: Appendix A the certified Abstract of Votes Cast, Appendix B the Election Summary Report, which is the part read. Pages read: 3 to 14 of the PDF; the report itself prints no word about being official or final (no print time on the page)."],"gaps":[["county","Clark County: small precincts' figures","Clark County's Statement of Vote prints '*' in place of the figures of a precinct with too few voters to keep a ballot secret; those precinct cells are not stored, and the county's official figures include them.","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx"],["county","Clark County: 5,306 precinct figures by kind of vote whose total is hidden","The county hides each kind of vote (Election Day, Early Vote, Mail) and the precinct's total on their own; where a precinct's total for a choice is hidden ('*') but one or more of its kinds is printed (often a 0 for mail), those printed kinds are left out too, since a precinct's figures by kind of vote are stored only beside its total. The county's official figures include them.","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx"],["state","The Secretary of State's statewide canvass","The Secretary of State's results sites (www.nvsos.gov, silverstateelection.nv.gov) answer programs with an Incapsula bot wall, so the statewide canvass (every county's figures for the statewide, multi-county and federal contests) is not read; John can save it in his own browser.","https://www.nvsos.gov/sos/elections/election-information/2022-election-information"],["county","Washoe County","Washoe County's website (www.washoecounty.gov) served this computer normally on 2026-10-01, but from 2026-10-23 its web firewall answers every request with an empty 404, so it is not asked; the county's past-results pages can be saved in John's own browser.","https://www.washoecounty.gov/voters/reporting_and_data/past-election-information/electionresults/2022generalelectionresults.php"],["county","Elko County","Elko County's canvass is a scanned document with no text layer.","https://elkocountynv.gov/departments/clerk/2024/2022%20General%20Canvass.pdf"],["county","Esmeralda County","No website of Esmeralda County's with election results was found.",""],["county","Eureka County","Eureka County's final results are a scanned document with no text layer.","https://www.eurekacountynv.gov/media/35sdtdh4/2022-general-election-final-results.pdf"],["county","Humboldt County","Humboldt County's abstract is a scan whose text layer is machine reading of the scan, and its statement of votes cast prints each contest's candidates across several pages; neither is read by this loader yet.","https://www.humboldtcountynv.gov/317/Elections"],["county","Lander County","No 2022 results document was found on Lander County's website.","https://www.landercountynv.org/government/clerk/election_information.php"],["county","Lincoln County","No results document was found on Lincoln County's website.","https://lincolncountynv.org/departments/clerks-office/elections/"],["county","Lyon County","Lyon County's official results are scanned pages with no text layer.","https://www.lyon-county.org/801/Elections"],["county","Mineral County","No results document was found on Mineral County's website.","https://mineralcountynv.us/government/clerk_treasurer/election.php"],["county","Nye County","Nye County's posted results are scanned pages; the only text report found is an election-week update headed 'Unofficial'.","https://www.nyecountynv.gov/1144/Past-Elections"],["county","Pershing County","No 2022 results document was found on Pershing County's website.","ht